<BaseLayout title="Cosmetic Peptide Stability and Packaging — Light, Oxygen, Moisture" description="Stability and packaging guidance for cosmetic peptide raw materials: light sensitivity, oxygen and oxidation, moisture control, container choice and storage conditions." canonical="/knowledge/cosmetic-peptide-stability-packaging/">
